Workflow: Schema

Purpose:
  Defines schema for workflow entities.

Required:
  @workflow <id>
  name <name>
  stages <stage-list>
  state <state>

Optional:
  domain <domain>
  conditions <condition-list>
  gates <gate-list>
  owner <role>

Example:
  @workflow WF-021
  name "Feature Development"
  stages:
    - BDD
    - CODE
    - UNIT
    - INTEGRATION
    - SECURITY
    - REVIEW
  state active

State: +
  
